8. Non-Functional Requirements
Security: TLS, JWT/OAuth2, input validation, role-based access control.

Scalability: Stateless services with horizontal scaling.

Availability: Health checks, load balancing, and database backups.

Performance: Redis caching and database indexing.

Observability: Centralized logs, metrics, and distributed tracing.

Maintainability: Layered architecture, automated testing, CI/CD.
